<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-14T06:49:14.429Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:49:14 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen abducted five people and shot two in a Plateau community, while bandits abducted three in Wase, Plateau and killed a 3‑year-old girl in Zamfara after a kidnapping. In Kaduna, IDPs demanded the release of four abducted members who remain in captivity and bandits killed a farmer after receiving a N56 million ransom. Armed thugs attacked Peter Obi opposition rallies and NDC supporters in Lagos, killing supporters and prompting a police probe. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQeEZocDhmNF9JMUJJZUZJTEROelQ4bFBlR0RNX3hHR3ExeHlGYnJ3Nm1HR3lCc3FoNU0tTXJUTDM0Qi1zMTMtYU5DNEF1Q0xLZWQ3YlFNNlFlQ01naUFvbnNGZE80NXZBT01tVDh3TXFSVXc2RU4tVklaanFiTWF5a214X1c2ZExmUXBpVklRX2pxODg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPX0RHTTNBUy1ScjJ4ekxwUXpTclJDRGZKSGM4cVR0Rnl6Qmozby1YM213czh1X3VEeDIwVmN0d2x3cWxCMXV4N2NORTl1Q2NBMTlzYXd5SEp2MlFNbVpSQjV6RThSUFFvTXlFTGxqMzhvYnpselNGRzRyOU5BNTMydUZxckpqUnVyOVhF?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPRXl0bGNGR0tzcExjQnhpOEZVektucGhMOTYxSHNTelQ5dGktTmxZeV9jaHh2dGVTUF9HN2oxMndueVFyT0R4bF9uU09GMVpRUFIyM1FaMGJfZVVxTk9OM21BZG92bHktSmk1eXBzdlNUQ2tCMWZ1Z2gybmFKRnQ2V09rbEVXd0lJaTRMUk1RUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOZXlhbnJjZzVuOHJESDFaVjdnWlZPaWc2Sm9mNlBhY3RIeXJabXVlTFF1V3R4UmczRC02UnY4cjNpaTQ5blBfTjhza0tSTXAtd0twenA4LUlmcUJORFBhZ2Y4UnEyYlJ6NFNvSlBtaW1xdzB3ZG5OTWRLZjQ5VnJPcnU2NTVUVFdUYnpEeWNJRHNiam1pWTBCLXdIS1FMSGpxaWlRb0lSNzZ5LWd3TGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxORnFPW